<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Kleovoulos of Rhodes -</p>
<p>100,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Taranto 18-27/1 $6.65 fio</p>
<p>40,000/30,000 Deiulemar.</p>
<p>ORE - Omiros - 220,000 tonnes ore Tuburao/Rotterdam plus Antwerp 1-15/1 $6.45 fio seven days shinc Kleimar.</p>
<p>Urgup - 130,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Beilun 15-30/1 $7.65 fio scale load/20,000 shinc Chinese charterers.</p>
</text>
